{"id":"n25000-1-7","stage":4,"title":"저고리 · 韩式短袄","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25000-1-7-1","ko":"우리 아이 한복을 좀 맞추려고 하는데요.","zh":"我们打算给孩子定制一套韩服。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"아이","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}},{"text":"한복을","meaning":"韩服","explanation":"한복：韩服；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한복","audio":"/audio/2674925563130f0470ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48061","senseId":"1","lemma":"한복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한복을","audio":"/audio/1cfb33961e79b9ec576c.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"맞추려고","meaning":"定做，订制","explanation":"맞추다：定做，订制；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"맞추다","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74127","senseId":"10","lemma":"맞추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞추려고","audio":"/audio/d9993c5e63fa5daea4bf.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데요.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데요","audio":"/audio/680c4e006f96eb3e103f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"2674925563130f04","term":"한복","zh":"韩服","audio":"/audio/2674925563130f0470ef.mp3","entryId":"48061","definition":"韩国的传统服装。","pronunciation":["한ː복"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"007d45bc6c182fe5","term":"맞추다","zh":"定做，订制","audio":"/audio/007d45bc6c182fe5443f.mp3","entryId":"74127","definition":"预定制作某种产品。","pronunciation":["맏추다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"打算做（-려고 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/085083fd200600ba2a8a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25000-1-7-2","ko":"아이니까 여러 가지 색깔이 들어간 저고리가 어떨까요?","zh":"因为是给孩子穿的，选上有多种颜色的短上衣怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이니까","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이니까","audio":"/audio/ef42b343625d5fbbdaee.mp3"}},{"text":"여러","meaning":"多个，许多，多种","explanation":"여러：多个，许多，多种","readings":[{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17300","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여러","audio":"/audio/9132eb626207a0b02762.mp3"}},{"text":"가지","meaning":"种，项，类别，个","explanation":"가지：种，项，类别，个","readi